  // becomes a straight lead-in ΓÇö inserted ON THE DUCT AXIS but at the WRONG elevation,
  // which shifts the whole bend off the downcomer centreline. The tube then neither meets
  // the downcomer squarely nor the tangential inlet squarely. That is the visible gap.
  //
  // The fix is to derive the exit FROM the reach rather than from the inlet:
